{
  "label": "mayadorm35",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label mayadorm35:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Maya’s door, awaiting whatever sort of excuse she’s going to throw at me tonight that will keep me from coming inside.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve just accepted it at this point.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There are some people out there who won’t let you know anything about them unless they absolutely have to.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "People like me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sure, a lot of that is because I can’t remember much of my story.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But, even if I did-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t think I’d want to share it with anyone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "My thoughts and my experiences are mine and mine alone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just like Maya’s are hers and hers alone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And the two of us are destined to forever remain that way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Detached from not only each other but the entire world around us.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Floating freely toward a place that can only exist in our minds.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you want?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To see you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I blurt out something smooth.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ew.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not very effective.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I come in?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maya?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You normally reject me right away.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does this mean I’m actually allowed in tonight?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is there anyone in the hall right now?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right now? No. It’s totally empty.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fine.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You may enter.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Blowing up in class...pleading for help at[school]...letting me into her room-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya is changing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether that change is good or bad is yet to be determined.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou1.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please make this quick. I’m very tired.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well then you probably shouldn't have invited me in.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I didn’t, you would have just stood out there knocking until I caved.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This was the easiest way to put an end to that.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So go on, get to tonight’s helping of witty banter and be on your way.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. Now I’m feeling really pressured all of a sudden.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not sure if I can come up with something witty enough for you off the top of my head.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A light in Ami’s side of the room begins to flicker.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It makes that soft, sad electrical noise you hear from some devices in the moments leading up to their deaths.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Any moment now, that light is sure to burn out.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder what else will burn out tonight?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou2.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you keep coming here when you know I don’t want you to?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who knows? Maybe I’ve just been worried about you lately.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do realize that you wouldn’t have to worry at all if you’d just listen to me, right?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t necessarily have a problem with worrying.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s nice being reminded that I’m not just some mindless affection robot wandering from dorm to dorm in exchange for more love points or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well I, for one, think it’s exhausting having to worry so much about everything.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is why I’ve resigned myself to bed already while everyone else is out having fun.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure that’s you being tired and not just you being a loser?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou3.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. I’m extremely sure.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will that be all?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It will not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then what else do you want?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To see you smile.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I try to be smooth again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ew.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not very effective.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What reason would I possibly have to smile right now?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Things are happening that I can’t predict. People are showing up that I’ve never seen before.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And to top it all off, I’m expected to just casually converse with the root of all of my problems in a dimly lit bedroom when all I want to do is sleep.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would you prefer I go talk to your friend Noriko instead?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou4.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...just...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stressed...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If staying here and annoying me keeps you away from her...fine. Whatever.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll stay awake all night if that’s what it takes.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like I should be happy for finally finding the key to spending more time with you...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But really I just feel even more worried than I did before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Good. Worry about me if that’s what you need to do.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou5.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know. I don’t like being seen like this.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? I think you look cute in your pajamas.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not talking about that...I’m talking about the way I’m acting, idiot.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": People who so freely express themselves are strange. I don’t know how they do it.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you trying to express, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou6.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Urgency?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Urgency in what way?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whichever way keeps you here the longest.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct me if I’m wrong, but isn’t it normally the other way around?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is nothing normal about anything anymore.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well what’s the reason for the sudden attachment then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why wait until someone you despise shows up to start saying things like that when I’ve been trying to get closer to you since I first came to the shrine?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s sit down.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re about to start a conversation that would be much easier if we’re both comfortable.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya turns away from me and takes a seat on her bed.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I expected her to use the kotatsu since it would help her keep her distance from me-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I guess that sometimes even stray cats want attention.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hopefully, this particular stray guides me toward what it is she’s looking for tonight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can only keep coming back to her for so long when there are so many other cats I also have to take care of.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou7.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya looks at me with a tinge of desperation that I don’t know what to make of.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Like she wants to say something, but fears that doing so would break the world or kill all of us or whatever other sort of catastrophic things could happen due to...time stuff.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe one day I’ll actually understand how any of this works.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you uncomfortable?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You definitely look like you are.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, I am. But not for the reasons you’re thinking of.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s true that you’re entirely too close right now, but what really makes me uncomfortable is figuring out how I am supposed to tell you this.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I remain silent and let her discomfort course through her veins and infect the rest of her tiny body.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There’s no need for me to talk during a time like this. Which works out wonderfully because-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whygodwhy",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/whygodwhy.png",
      "alt": "whygodwhy"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou7.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What was I thinking just now?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are not who I thought you were at first.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you still might be. But there’s a high likelihood you’re not.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who did you think I was at first?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not you.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That doesn’t help.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou8.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...the fact that you still pretend to be so dense during times like this is even further proving my thoughts correct.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And...this is hard to do since I can’t reveal too much without the fear of-",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whygodwhy",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/whygodwhy.png",
      "alt": "whygodwhy"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene imissyou9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/imissyou9.webp",
      "alt": "imissyou9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Without the fear of what?",
